flowchart TB
    user[Пользователь · браузер]
    geocoding[Nominatim · поиск региона]
    tiles[OpenStreetMap · тайлы]
    sources[Earth Search / Planetary Computer / Open-Meteo / OSM]
    subgraph app[TerraLens · Docker Compose]
        web[Next.js · React / карта / графики]
        api[Django / DRF · HTTP API]
        broker[(Redis · Celery broker / cache)]
        worker[Celery worker · providers + terralens_ml]
        scheduler[Celery Beat · reconcile / retention]
        db[(PostgreSQL / PostGIS)]
        files[(Artifact volume · snapshots / models / exports)]
        web -->|same-origin /api/v1| api
        api -->|SQL · транзакции| db
        api -->|enqueue after commit| broker
        scheduler -->|периодические задания| broker
        broker -->|job_id| worker
        worker -->|progress / результаты| db
        worker -->|read / write · SHA-256| files
        api -->|download / registry| files
    end
    api -->|HTTPS · geocoding| geocoding
    user -->|HTTP · localhost:3001| web
    api -->|HTTPS · geocoding| geocoding
    user -->|HTTPS · тайлы| tiles
    worker -->|HTTPS · STAC / COG / JSON| sources
    subgraph offline[Автономный запуск · API и БД не требуются]
        input[Test CSV + model / manifest]
        cli[terralens_ml predict / validate]
        output[Submission CSV + checksum]
        input --> cli --> output
    end
